      "writtenOn": "2025-03-06T01:55:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Guarding it with vmid/pas_id being set will mean I can\u0027t launch a normal VM with CMA. How do we deal with this? Probably once we have guest_memfd, we can have another arg to differentiate b/w CMA and normal file?",
