      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point. Will `GH_VM_ANDROID_MAP_CMA_MEM` fail if the FD isn\u0027t CMA backed? If so, maybe you can always call it like this, but if you get a certain error code back, fallback to the `android_lend_user_memory_region` call?",
